      "message": "fix(ui): the tool library preview draws a thread mill's teeth\n\nThe 3D model and the side view of the tool library window drew a thread\nmill as the crest cylinder of Tool::profile over the whole cutting\nlength. A new display-only module (tool_library_dialog/thread_form.rs)\ndraws the cutting length as the teeth: the core at the tooth roots and\none V tooth of the form angle per row (one tooth on a single-form). The\nsteel above it (the shank, or a drawn neck) stays. Tool::profile, the\ncollision envelope, toolpaths and posts do not change.\n\nFixes #4451\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
